{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12090","headline":"送张将军征西 · 钱起","name":"送张将军征西","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安少年唯好武，金殿承恩争破虏。\n沙场烽火隔天山，铁骑征西几岁还。\n战处黑云霾翰海，愁中明月度阳关。\n玉笛声悲离酌晚，金方路极行人远。\n计日霜戈尽敌归，回首戎城空落晖。\n始笑子卿心计失，徒看海上节旄稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}